
Authors of Braving
==================

    Braving is developed and maintained by
    gajgaje2000 <gajgaje2000@gmail.com>.

    Other contributors to the Braving project are credited collectively
    as The Braving Contributors.

    Major parts of Braving are based on code written by Brave Software, Inc.
    <https://brave.com/>, specifically the Brave Core browser and Shields
    protection subsystems. Without this code, Braving wouldn't exist.

    Upstream browser engine foundations are based on the Chromium open-source
    project <https://www.chromium.org/>, developed and maintained by Google LLC
    and the Chromium Authors.

    Content blocking and network privacy filter specifications are based
    on work by Raymond Hill (gorhill) and the uBlock Origin project
    <https://github.com/gorhill/uBlock>, as well as filter list maintainers
    from EasyList, EasyPrivacy, and Fanboy's filter lists.

    The GitLab CI/CD pipeline automation and package caching architecture
    powering automated reproducible builds was created and optimized
    for GitLab infrastructure.

    Many people have reported bugs, suggested improvements, and assisted
    with testing. Most of these people and projects are mentioned in the
    file THANKS.

